        "band_heading": "Unlock Your RAM 5th Gen 2500HD’s True Potential with an ORI GVM Upgrade",
        "band_background": "#000000",
        "band_text_color": "#56bdc2",
        "body": "<p>The 5th Gen RAM 2500HD is undeniably one of the most capable heavy-duty trucks ever built. However, once you start loading up with heavy accessories or running a full tray and canopy conversion, Australia's strict payload limits can quickly hold you back.</p><p>That changes with an <strong>Offroad Industries (ORI) GVM upgrade</strong>.</p><p>As a Federally Approved Second Stage Manufacturer (SSM), ORI is leading the industry in GVM upgrades for the RAM 2500HD. We specialize in the critical <strong>NB1 to NB2 category pathway</strong>, delivering a massive payload increase alongside complete legal peace of mind.</p><h3>Why Choose an ORI GVM Upgrade?</h3><ul><li><strong>The NB1 to NB2 Pathway:</strong> By officially reclassifying your RAM 2500HD from the NB1 to the NB2 vehicle category, our engineered upgrade safely and legally unlocks a significantly higher payload capacity for all your heavy-duty builds.</li><li><strong>Premium FOX & BDS Components:</strong> We don't just increase your load limits; we upgrade your entire ride. Our packages feature top-tier suspension components from <strong>FOX</strong> and <strong>BDS</strong>, ensuring unmatched performance, durability, and ride quality whether you're on the highway or off the grid.</li><li><strong>Pre-Rego & Post-Rego Flexibility:</strong> Whether you are upgrading a brand-new vehicle prior to its first registration (Federal compliance) or modifying a truck that is already on the road (State-based compliance), our packages are fully backed and recognized.</li></ul><p><strong>Important Note:</strong> This GVM upgrade is exclusively available for official RAM Trucks Australia delivered and converted vehicles.</p><p>Upgrade your RAM 2500 5th Gen with a package designed specifically for the platform. Experience a massive payload increase, superior suspension performance, and the confidence that your truck is 100% road-legal across Australia.</p>",
        "disclaimer": "",
        "style": "light",
        "padding_top": 72,
        "padding_bottom": 72
      }
